BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Littoralicious//Terroir Siracusa//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:Siracusa — eat & drink checklist
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-1@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Granita di mandorla con brioche — Almond ice\, coarse-grained\, with a warm brioche.
DESCRIPTION:Say: gra-NEE-ta dee man-DOR-la. Assenza makes it with Noto almonds\; breakfast here\, all year. Best: Caffè Sicilia\, Noto — at opening
LOCATION:Caffè Sicilia\, Noto — at opening
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Caff%C3%A8+Sicilia+Noto+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-2@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Cannolo and cassata — Fried shell with ricotta\; the baroque ricotta cake.
DESCRIPTION:Say: kan-NO-lo · kas-SA-ta. Convent pastry\, pared back by a pastry cook who subtracts sugar rather than adds it. Best: Caffè Sicilia\, Noto
LOCATION:Caffè Sicilia\, Noto
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Caff%C3%A8+Sicilia+Noto+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-3@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Cioccolato di Modica — Chocolate worked cold\, gritty with sugar crystals.
DESCRIPTION:Say: chok-ko-LA-to dee MO-dee-ka. IGP since 2018\; Bonajuto\, the oldest maker\, left the consortium. Best: Antica Dolceria Bonajuto\, Modica
LOCATION:Antica Dolceria Bonajuto\, Modica
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Antica+Dolceria+Bonajuto+Modica+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-4@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:'Mpanatigghi — Crescent pastries of minced beef\, chocolate\, almond and spice.
DESCRIPTION:Say: m-pa-na-TEEG-ghee. Meat and chocolate in one sweet. Best: Antica Dolceria Bonajuto\, Modica
LOCATION:Antica Dolceria Bonajuto\, Modica
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Antica+Dolceria+Bonajuto+Modica+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-5@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Cremolata — Modica's granita: fruit-heavy\, creamier\, with nuts.
DESCRIPTION:Say: kre-mo-LA-ta. The fig one with walnut and Modica chocolate is the town's own. Best: Rosy Bar\, Modica
LOCATION:Rosy Bar\, Modica
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rosy+Bar+Modica+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-6@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Panino di Borderi — A sandwich built to order with the house's own cheeses.
DESCRIPTION:Say: pa-NEE-no. The market's famous queue — unverified for 2026\, check first. Best: Caseificio Borderi\, Ortigia market
LOCATION:Caseificio Borderi\, Ortigia market
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Caseificio+Borderi+Ortigia+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-7@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Busiate con bottarga di tonno — Twisted pasta with grated dried tuna roe.
DESCRIPTION:Say: boo-zee-AH-te con bot-TAR-ga. The tonnara is gone\; the tuna still comes home as bottarga. Best: Campisi\, Marzamemi
LOCATION:Campisi\, Marzamemi
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Campisi+Marzamemi+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-8@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Spaghetti delle Sirene — Prawns and sea urchins.
DESCRIPTION:Say: spa-GET-tee. Ortigia's long-standing serious room\, since 1985. Best: Don Camillo\, Ortigia
LOCATION:Don Camillo\, Ortigia
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Don+Camillo+Ortigia+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-9@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Moscato di Siracusa — The sweet white of Siracusa\, revived.
DESCRIPTION:Say: mos-KA-to. Nearly lost\; Pupillo brought it back. Best: Cantine Pupillo\, Siracusa
LOCATION:Cantine Pupillo\, Siracusa
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cantine+Pupillo+Siracusa+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:siracusa-liste-10@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Cerasuolo di Vittoria — Nero d'Avola and Frappato\, light-red and cherry-scented.
DESCRIPTION:Say: che-ra-SWO-lo dee vit-TOR-ya. Sicily's only DOCG\; COS makes some in clay amphorae. Best: COS\, Vittoria
LOCATION:COS\, Vittoria
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=COS+Vittoria+Sicilia
END:VTODO
END:VCALENDAR
